<title>THAILAND: Thai Jan C/A deficit widens to 22.5 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Jan C/A deficit widens to 22.5 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's January current account deficit widened to a preliminary 22.5 billion baht from 19.1 billion baht deficit in December, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   Jan 97	 Dec 96	Jan 96</p>
<p>				 22.5	   19.1	  28.9</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 6520642</p>
</text>
